----------------------------------------------------------------------------
NOTE ON DATA (data/gswa/)
----------------------------------------------------------------------------
The MIT license above covers the CODE in this repository. The geochemical
sample data and mineral-deposit site labels under data/gswa/ are derived from
public government geoscience datasets (Geological Survey of Western Australia /
WAMEX, and a public Canadian regional geochemical survey). They are
redistributed here for research reproducibility and remain subject to their
original providers' terms. If you use the data, cite the original surveys in
addition to this repository. See docs/datasets.md for provenance.
